@19001 = ~Acid Elemental~
@19002 = ~The Acid Comes to Life~
@19003 = ~Raging Render~
@19004 = ~*When you arrive in the area, a voice begins to echo in your head. It says: "Welcome to the Maze, adventurers. Don't look for the exit, there isn't one. Don't look for the boss, there isn't one either. To win your rune, all you have to do is survive for 10 minutes. But don't think it will be easy. Do you know the Render? We owe this marvel of nature to the perverted experiments that took place in Darkhold. For my challenge, I reproduced it, improved it, and multiplied it. There are three of them here, and they have only one thing in mind: to tear you to shreds. They are powerful, deadly, enraged, and immortal: don't try to kill them, as that will only recreate them in the center of the maze. So... let the hunt begin!" When the voice falls silent, you know what you have to do.*~
@19005 = ~"Still alive? Promising. I'll be waiting for you. Here's your rune; you may leave."~
@19006 = ~Unknown Presence~
